                      "“愿意并且能够”两个词都要有。只想要而买不起，不是有效需求。\n\n作图：价格在纵轴，数量在横轴，需求曲线向右下。价格自己变化不要平移曲线。收入增加使正常品的需求曲线向右移动。在新价格还没说的时候，不要声称均衡价格已经上升——那要等供给一起看。",
                      "Both “willing” and “able” are required. Wanting a good you cannot pay for is not effective demand.\n\nPrice goes on the vertical axis and quantity on the horizontal. The demand curve slopes down. A change in the good’s own price does not shift the curve. Higher income shifts demand for a normal good to the right. Until supply is in the diagram, do not claim the equilibrium price has already risen.",
                      "茶和咖啡是替代品。咖啡价格上升，人们改买茶，茶的需求曲线向右移动。这不是茶的价格变了。",
                      "Tea and coffee are substitutes. If the price of coffee rises, people switch to tea and the demand curve for tea shifts right. The price of tea itself has not changed.",
