                "8 分论述。Discuss whether the price mechanism is always the best way to allocate resources. 要有定义或知识、至少一条分析链、一个相反论点，以及一句判断。系统按要点给分，论证是否写完整请对照参考答案。",
                "8-mark essay. Discuss whether the price mechanism is always the best way to allocate resources. Include knowledge, at least one chain of analysis, an opposing point and a judgement. Key points are marked automatically; compare the completeness of the argument with the sample.",
                "见解析中的参考结构。",
                "参考结构：价格机制用价格的升降传递哪里该多生产、哪里该少买。例如需求增加造成短缺，价格上升，生产者因利润增加供给，资源被配置到该产品（分析链）。然而出价高不等于需要最迫切：低收入家庭可能买不起住房，而公共品没有价格可传递（相反面）。判断：价格机制适合许多私人商品，因为信息和激励都快；在住房、基本医疗和公共品上，混合经济中的政府干预可以补上它漏掉的人，所以它不是在任何情况下都最好。",
                "A possible shape: the price mechanism uses rising and falling prices to signal where to produce more and where to buy less. For example, higher demand creates a shortage, price rises, profit increases supply, and resources move toward that good (the chain). But a high bid is not the same as the most urgent need: a low-income household may not afford housing, and a public good has no price to transmit (the other side). Judgement: the price mechanism suits many private goods because the information and the incentive are fast; for housing, basic healthcare and public goods, government action in a mixed economy can reach the people it misses, so it is not best in every case.",
